@model WhlgPublicWebsite.Models.Questionnaire.EligibleViewModel

<p class="govuk-body">
    Your application details will be shared with the <b>Greater London Authority (GLA)</b>, which is managing Warm Homes: Local Grant applications on behalf of your borough using an online platform called Shared Works.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
    If you have provided an email, you will be sent an email from <a href="mailto:no-reply@warmer-homes.london">no-reply@warmer-homes.london</a>. 
    The GLA will contact you regarding the next steps and any information needed to support your application. 
    For information about how your personal data will be used, please read the <a href="https://www.london.gov.uk/privacy-policies/warmer-homes-privacy-notice">Warmer Homes privacy notice | London City Hall</a>.
</p>